<h2>Narrow, and on paper</h2>
<p>Under 64rem the side becomes a band across the top — photograph beside the name, the blocks in a row under them — and the career follows. Under 48rem everything is one column. <code>PDF</code> prints it: the bar and the foot go, the side lets go of the window and becomes the left column of an A4 sheet, the accent survives, and no role, section or card is cut by a page break.</p>
